WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:02.736
Milk.

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:08.041
The civilized way to drink it is out of a
glass versus guzzling it out of a jug.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:12.278
Unless, of course, you're celebrate
a win at the Indy 500.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.116
But it was no victory
when a Canadian real estate agent

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:19.686
got caught on surveillance video,
opening the fridge

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:23.423
and chugging out of the milk
jug for about 6 seconds

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.426
alone in Lescott Fullerton's home,

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:29.496
waiting to show it to potential buyers.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.997
Why? Why?

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.665
Why would somebody do that?

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.402
Mike Rose almost closed the fridge,

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.705
then opened it again
for another lingering look.

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:43.343
The Fullerton's we're angry,
having each lost a parent to COVID.

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:46.780
The idea of it
just so that it just grosses me out.

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.616
Because of the way he got milk

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:54.521
Mike Rose
got whacked with almost 17,000 U.S.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.723
dollars in penalties and costs.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:00.360
The British Columbia Financial Services
Authority calls

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.762
it conduct unbecoming.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:07.634
The homeowner confronted Rose last summer
when the episode happened.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.468
I asked him, I said,

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.804
Is there anything you want to tell me
about the last time you were in my home?

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.740
And he said, Oh, the milk incident.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.809
He was just so nonchalant about it.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:21.147
Fullerton says he also accidentally
broke her couch by sitting on the arm.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.184
CNN wasn't able to reach Rose, but

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:29.055
he has apologized for his very unfortunate
and very unclear

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:33.927
touristic decision
telling local outlet CFTC.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.963
I have never done
this kind of thing before, nor

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:39.265
will I ever behave in this way again.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:43.837
He told the authority
he was unusually dehydrated

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:48.541
because he was taking new medication
and under considerable stress.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.777
What did you do with the milk?

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:51.744
I threw it away.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.047
Hide your milk when Mike's around.

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:56.783
Wrote one joker on Rose's Facebook.

00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:00.286
He's had to move to a new real estate
firm.

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:05.325
Mike Rose found out what
the star of Anchor Man already knew.

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.560
Milk was a bad choice.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.330
Jimmy must CNN get a glass.

